# fast_battery S0 ABC script: yosys's built-in default for -genlib WITHOUT dretime.
#
# The default script is:
#   strash; &get -n; &fraig -x; &put; scorr; dc2; dretime; strash;
#   &get -n; &dch -f; &nf {D}; &put
# but in the installed yosys 0.69+ (conda-forge) the `dretime` step was PROVEN
# (2026-10-01, SAT miter pre-abc vs post-abc: counterexample found) to produce
# a functionally WRONG mapping for mix_h_xorspn3. This file is the default
# with dretime removed; the no-dretime mapping was SAT-PROVEN equivalent
# (pre-abc vs post-abc miter: "SAT proof finished - no model found: SUCCESS").
#
# NOTE: pass via `-script <this file>`. The `-script +cmd1,cmd2,...` string
# form does NOT work in this build (commands aren't separated -> ABC emits
# unmapped $lut cells).
strash; &get -n; &fraig -x; &put; scorr; dc2; strash; &get -n; &dch -f; &nf; &put
